{"availability":"available","full":"matthummel-pa/keepary","name":"keepary","description":"Keepary is a personal experiment, not a commercial product. I built it as a hands-on way to practice full-stack development end to end — and to explore what it's like to design and ship a real, working application in collaboration with Claude.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-16T12:29:01Z","updated":"2026-09-01T06:25:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://keepary.netlify.app/","topics":["netlify","reactjs","supabase","vibe-coding"],"demo":"https://keepary.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.290Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.290Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.290Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.290Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A private, invite-only social space for families and close friends — the calm internet, without the algorithm.","Keepary is a self-contained \"social, but only us\" web app: a private feed, member profiles, and real-time chat for an invite-only circle of family and friends — with a handful of supporting utilities (document vault, notes, calendar). No ads, no algorithmic ranking, no data harvesting. Access is gated by an explicit allowlist, and every table is protected by Postgres Row-Level Security.","This is a personal experiment, not a commercial product. It includes authentication, authorization, real-time data, file storage, a serverless backend, and a privacy/security surface (2FA, account deactivation, data export, blocking)."],"features":["🔐 Real auth & RLS — Supabase Auth with an email allowlist enforced by a signup trigger, plus Row-Level Security policies on every table.","🛡️ Security surface — TOTP two-factor auth, inactivity auto-lock, password strength metering, \"sign out everywhere,\" and WordPress-style roles (administrator → subscriber → friend).","🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Social graph — one-way follows and mutual friend requests, a member directory, and per-page friend visibility controls.","💬 Real-time chat — Slack/Discord-style channels and DMs with live updates and emoji reactions over Supabase Realtime.","📰 Private feed — Bluesky-style posts with likes, comments, and sharing, visible only inside your circle."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthummel-pa/keepary/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"25cbe386a1f61c7594e875bfbc3e1b152dbfe352ea0f03748a716b0c43472a21","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.407Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.407Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A private, invite-only social space for families and close friends — the calm internet, without the algorithm.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthummel-pa/keepary/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"25cbe386a1f61c7594e875bfbc3e1b152dbfe352ea0f03748a716b0c43472a21","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthummel-pa/keepary/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.407Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-01T06:25:20Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matthummel-pa/keepary/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T04:07:47.408Z","hash":"25cbe386a1f61c7594e875bfbc3e1b152dbfe352ea0f03748a716b0c43472a21","originalBytes":6994,"storedBytes":6994,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["supabase","security","vite","data","npm","private","run","auth","chat","email","row-level","build","calendar","feed","keepary","key","notes","profiles","project","schema.md","social","spa","storage","vault","account","app","backend","bash","edge","every","friend","functions","invite-only","license","live","only","owner","personal","policies","postgres","react","real-time","realtime","supporting","table","totp","admin","allowlist","architecture.md","blocking","bucket","built","commercial","cron","css","deactivation","deno","dev","docs","document